I would not use the nethackrc at all. My solution would go like this:
- Put all general options (like IBMgraphics or number_pad and that
stuff) in the variable $OPTS
- Put all options only used for certain types of characters (if any) in
variables like $thinkers or $fighters
- Define which class/race combinations use what names and which of those
variables apply to them. eg:
Monk-h="$magic-user,name:Moenchlein Heino"
Barb-o="$fighter,name:HauDruff"
- Choose the class-race combination
- Set $NETHACKOPTIONS to $OPTS,$Monk-h or whatever Class-Race-Combi was
chosen.

